meta {
  name: Get Site Data
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/site-data
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## Get Site Data

  Public endpoint. Returns all public site data (system config, hero banners, ad banners, announcements).
  Used on site mount to populate global state.

  ### Success Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "system_config": { ... },
      "hero_banners": [...],
      "ad_banners": [...],
      "announcements": [...]
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Error Responses
  - **500** — Server error
}
